<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's interior Iowa and southern Minnesota actual hog receipts were 100,000 head, compared with that day's estimate of 105,000, USDA said.</p>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 per cwt lower compared to the midsession Monday.</p>
<p>				  Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    51.00 -52.00	  52.00 -53.00</p>
<p>few			50.50 -52.50	  51.50 -53.50</p>
<p>Sows: 500 dn. steady to 2.00 higher, over 500 steady. US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  41.00 -45.00	  42.50 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -47.00	  44.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    49.00 -52.50	  49.00 -53.50</p>
